entries[91089] = { ["name"] = "Proto-Drake Skeleton", ["text"] = "2 sec cast 5\nProto-drakes are the primitive ancestors of modern dragons. By popular legend, the titans created the Aspects from Galakrond, a massive proto-drake whose remains can still be seen in the Dragonblight. Proto-drakes are generally bestial and display none of the great intelligence and wisdom of true dragons.\nProto-Drake Skeleton\nBinds when picked up" }
